# Build-context filter for webapp/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# next to the Dockerfile in preference to the repository-root .dockerignore).
# Only webapp/ is copied by this Dockerfile, so exclude everything else.
*
!webapp/
# One script, not the tree: stage 3 cannot run alone without the stage-2 workbook
# this writes, and benchmarks/ otherwise carries ~21 MB of corpus PDFs.
!benchmarks/run_stage3_only.sh
webapp/data/
webapp/.venv/
webapp/**/__pycache__/
webapp/**/*.pyc
